{
  "id": "6c0d3e4a-1b52-4a8f-9d21-0e7f5a3c6c01",
  "description": "The default player character's controls: WASD or the left stick to walk, the mouse or the right stick to turn, Space or the bottom face button to jump, Shift or the left stick click to sprint. Priority 0, the base layer.",
  "priority": 0,
  "categories": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "name": "Movement",
      "entries": [
        {
          "id": 1,
